Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 26.07.2021 passed by the III Addl. District and Sessions Judge, and Addl.
MACT, Ramanagara in MVC.No.111/2016 is modified;
iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.79,000/- as against Rs.58,000/- with interest @
6% p.a. from the date of petition till realization;
iv) The entire compensation amount shall be paid by the respondent within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of copy of this order;
v) All other terms of apportionment and deposits as ordered by the tribunal is retained.

